# Raw hero sequence: 300 PNGs, ~220 MB. Kept outside the repository entirely.
# public/hero/ holds the encoded WebP tiers (~4 MB) and IS committed, so a
# clone can build without the source frames. Re-encode with:
#   node scripts/encode-hero.mjs --src <dir-of-pngs> --out public/hero
*.psd
/raw-hero/
